#. Tag: title
#: socks.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "SOCKS"
msgstr "SOCKS"

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"SOCKS is a protocol to execute proxy requests for a client. SOCKS is capable "
"of authentication and encryption of traffic, and is often found in corporate "
"settings, as opposed to home users. For more information about SOCKS, see "
"the <ulink url=\"http://www.socks.nec.com\">NEC</ulink> website"
msgstr ""
"SOCKS é un protocolo para executar pedidos proxy para un cliente. SOCKS pode "
"autenticar e cifrar o tránsito, e é moi utilizado en sistemas corporativos, "
"e pouco en domésticos. Para máis información acerca de SOCKS, consulte o "
"sítio web de <ulink url=\"http://www.socks.nec.com\">NEC</ulink>"

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this module you can enable most of the network aware &kde; applications "
"to transparently use SOCKS."
msgstr ""
"Con este módulo pode habilitar a utilización transparente de SOCKS na "
"maioría dos programas de &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting up of a SOCKS client is outside the scope of this document, and the "
"differences between the commonly used ones are very large. If you already "
"have a working SOCKS implementation, allowing you to use commandline clients "
"(for example, if <command>lynx</command> or <command>ftp</command> are "
"already working) then you can simply check the <guilabel>Enable SOCKS "
"support</guilabel> checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Este documento non trata acerca de como configurar un cliente SOCKS, ademáis "
"as diferenzas entre os empregados máis habitualmente son moi grandes. Se xa "
"ten unha implementación de SOCKS a traballar que lle permita empregar "
"clientes da liña de comandos (por exemplo, se xa funcionan <command>lynx</"
"command> ou <command>ftp</command>) entón pode simplesmente sinalar a opción "
"<guilabel>Habilitar o soporte de SOCKS</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this box is checked, several further options become available to you."
msgstr "Se sinala esta opción, terá máis opcións disponíbeis."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, you should select which of the various SOCKS clients you have "
"installed on your computer. &kde; will attempt to find this out by itself, "
"if you choose <guilabel>Auto detect</guilabel>. If you know the client you "
"have, you could choose either <guilabel>NEC Socks</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>Dante</guilabel>. If you have a custom built SOCKS library to use, "
"you can select <guilabel>Use custom library</guilabel> and then enter the "
"path to it in the <guilabel>Path</guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"Antes, debe escoller cal dos clientes SOCKS ten instalado no ordenaodr. Se "
"escolle <guilabel>Detectar automaticamente</guilabel>, &kde; tentará "
"adiviñar isto por si. Se coñece cal cliente ten, podería escoller "
"<guilabel>NEC Socks</guilabel> ou <guilabel>Dante</guilabel>. Se emprega "
"unha biblioteca de SOCKS construida por si, pode escoller <guilabel>Empregar "
"unha biblioteca personalizada</guilabel> e logo inserir a rota a ela no "
"campo <guilabel>Rota</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want &kde; to auto detect the SOCKS library in use, but you suspect "
"it isn't looking in the right places or you have installed it in a non-"
"standard location, then you can add further paths to be searched in the "
"bottom of this panel. Use the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> to add or remove paths."
msgstr ""
"Se quere que &kde; detecte automaticamente a biblioteca SOCKS que está a "
"utilizar, pero sospeita que non a está a procurar no lugar non estándar onde "
"a ten instalada, pode engadir máis rotas de procura no fondo deste panel. "
"Empregue o botón <guibutton>Engadir</guibutton> e <guibutton>Eliminar</"
"guibutton> para engadir ou eliminar rotas."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At any time while filling in this module, you can press the <guibutton>Test</"
"guibutton> button, and &kde; will report immediately with a message box to "
"tell you if it could find and initialize SOCKS or not."
msgstr ""
"En calquera momento, pode premer no botón <guibutton>Probar</guibutton>, e "
"&kde; informarao imediatamente de se puido achar e inicir SOCKS ou non."

#. Tag: para
#: socks.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changes made here will not affect any applications that are already open. "
"You will need to close and restart them before they are able to connect via "
"SOCKS."
msgstr ""
"As modificacións que faga aquí non afectarán a nengún programa que xa estexa "
"aberto. Poida que precise pechalos e reinicialos para que podan conectar "
"mediante SOCKS."

